; read-absence-honesty-band.fk — the read and connect organs answer the
; axiom-1 nothing for what NEVER WAS, and reserve "" for what exists and is
; empty. Healed 2026-08-27 with host-exec's contract as the anchor: a file
; that never was / a directory with no byte to give / a peer never reached
; (DNS, refused TCP, every TLS branch where no byte came from a verified
; peer, the certificate-verify branch above all) answer nothing; a present
; empty file and a connected silent peer answer "". Before this, all of
; them wore one skin ("" — the emptymask), and callers stood existence
; probes and ledger first-appends on the conflation; those callers now name
; the absence with nothing? and choose its meaning in their own source.
;
; PROOF LEVEL: FOURTH-ARM ONLY — sock_request/tls_request bind on fkwu
; alone, and read_file's Go arm already answered VNull for absence (this
; heal ENDED a live cross-arm divergence); the Go twin witnesses are
; TestHostReadAbsentAnswersNothing and the read_file shape itself
; (form-kernel-go main.go readFileTextNative). Run:
;   ./fkwu form/form-stdlib/tests/read-absence-honesty-band.fk
;
; The refused-connection legs speak to 127.0.0.1:9 (discard; closed on
; every witnessed host) — a listener there would fail those legs loudly,
; which is the honest direction for a wrong assumption.
;
; Bits (power-of-two weights):
;    1  a file that never was answers nothing
;    2  a present empty file (/dev/null) answers "" — a string, len 0
;    4  real bytes cross (this band reads its own first line)
;    8  a directory answers nothing (no byte was ever measured)
;   16  sock_request to an unresolvable name answers nothing
;   32  sock_request to a refused port answers nothing
;   64  tls_request that never reached a verified peer answers nothing
; Verdict 127
; witnessed: 2026-08-27 -> 127
(do
    (let m (read_file "/nonexistent-read-absence-honesty-probe"))
    (let c0 (if (nothing? m) 1 0))

    (let e (read_file "/dev/null"))
    (let c1 (if (nothing? e) 0 (if (eq (str_len e) 0) 2 0)))

    (let s (read_file "form/form-stdlib/tests/read-absence-honesty-band.fk"))
    (let c2 (if (nothing? s) 0 (if (gt (str_len s) 0) 4 0)))

    (let d (read_file "/tmp"))
    (let c3 (if (nothing? d) 8 0))

    (let a (sock_request "unresolvable-read-absence.invalid" "80" "x"))
    (let c4 (if (nothing? a) 16 0))

    (let b (sock_request "127.0.0.1" "9" "x"))
    (let c5 (if (nothing? b) 32 0))

    (let t (tls_request "127.0.0.1" "9" "x"))
    (let c6 (if (nothing? t) 64 0))

    (add c0 (add c1 (add c2 (add c3 (add c4 (add c5 c6)))))))
